      "x": 54,
      "y": 682,
      "width": 1572,
      "height": 92.4,
      "text": "Public / ok to show: plantId, period, methodId, requester, their bands, band_id\nPrivate / never to hub or counterpart: E, P, salt, exact intensity, recipe, utilization\nGovernment fat book stays off this product. K-ETS submission is a parallel track.\nA single cap is a ladder with two rungs. Design for the ladder.",
      "originalText": "Public / ok to show: plantId, period, methodId, requester, their bands, band_id\nPrivate / never to hub or counterpart: E, P, salt, exact intensity, recipe, utilization\nGovernment fat book stays off this product. K-ETS submission is a parallel track.\nA single cap is a ladder with two rungs. Design for the ladder.",
